activity Identify Threat
activity Examine Threat
activity Prioritize Threat
activity Mitigate Threat
activity Document Threat
activity Assess Threat
bind Identify Threat: Threat State
bind Examine Threat: Threat Degree, Effect Rating
bind Prioritize Threat: Threat Degree
bind Mitigate Threat: Mitigation Strategy
bind Document Threat: Threat State
bind Assess Threat: Response Time
Threat Degree: integer between 1 and 10
Effect Rating: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Threat State: Identified, Analyzed, Mitigated, Reported
Mitigation Strategy: Isolation, Patch, Monitor
Response Time: integer between 1 and 72
Init[Identify Threat] | |
End[Assess Threat] | |
Chain Response[Identify Threat, Examine Threat] | | |0,2,h
Response[Examine Threat, Prioritize Threat] | | |
Precedence[Mitigate Threat, Prioritize Threat] |A.Threat Degree > 5 | |
Response[Mitigate Threat, Document Threat] | | |
Chain Succession[Document Threat, Assess Threat] |A.Threat State is Reported | |
Existence[Examine Threat] | |
Chain Response[Mitigate Threat, Assess Threat] | | |0,48,h
Not Chain Succession[Mitigate Threat, Mitigate Threat] | |A.Mitigation Strategy != T.Mitigation Strategy |